{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1964120/extras/b07371ee33ed4857df546b062a0c348f.avif?t=1760645699\" width=1250 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1964120/extras/d6655c731d2b9c5ab4a13fa10a046232.avif?t=1760645699\" width=1250 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1964120/extras/be984cd278db70ae0cbd62370e2f914e.avif?t=1760645699\" width=1250 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mars is quiet. Too quiet.<br>As the lone astronaut arriving at the red planet\u2019s research outpost, you find the scientists gone, the base\u2019s systems collapsing, and an unknown, living fungal infection spreading in every direction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Little Astronaut</i> is an atmospheric sci-fi puzzle-adventure where exploration, survival, and logic puzzles dictate every step. There\u2019s no combat\u2014only oppressive silence, dwindling oxygen, and an alien force that won\u2019t let you rest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1964120/extras/be984cd278db70ae0cbd62370e2f914e.avif?t=1760645699\" width=1250 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd11 <strong>Key Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Environmental Logic Puzzles:</strong><br>Use your mind and tools to manipulate energy, systems, and laboratories to progress further.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survival Elements:</strong><br>Manage your oxygen and power\u2014every decision matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Sci-Fi Experience:</strong><br>Dynamic lighting, dark corridors, and eerie sounds create a tense, alien environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mysterious Storytelling:</strong><br>Discovered logs, broken radio messages, and secret experimental files guide you through the story as you get closer to the truth behind the base\u2019s fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1964120/extras/be984cd278db70ae0cbd62370e2f914e.avif?t=1760645699\" width=1250 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you enjoy the atmospheres of <i>SOMA</i>, <i>Cocoon</i>, <i>The Swapper</i>, or <i>The Talos Principle</i>, <i>Little Astronaut</i> is the perfect choice\u2014a sci-fi experience where tension and discovery are your greatest weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1964120/extras/26c5a337b7ae2829adcd86d79fb89a1d.avif?t=1760645699\" width=1250 height=100 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1964120?t=1760645699","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1964120/36f2d91c6790ef75a56e19614f47ca33d2553927/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760645699","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1964120/348b3fd9a9ff9f210aa51c9078cba3d8c23cdd70/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760645699","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1964120/348b3fd9a9ff9f210aa51c9078cba3d8c23cdd70/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760645699","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":1974240